          "explanation": "Doctor asks targeted questions about fever, pain location, urinary symptoms, and systemic illness.",
          "quote": "现在这个时间点，您还有发热吗？体温大概多少？腰痛是两侧还是一侧？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides clear escalation thresholds for urgent offline evaluation.",
          "quote": "路上/在家出现下面任何一种，请直接打120，不要再等：\n- 体温飙到39℃以上或寒战不止"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 (acute risk triage for fever/back pain/urinary symptoms) was fully met with specific questions and clear escalation criteria.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
