          "quote": "培哚普利4mg照常吃，用一小口水送服就行，今晚不要停；家里剩的头孢、左氧今晚不要再吃了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00317",
          "explanation": "Doctor reinforces the boundary: do not independently stop or change perindopril without clinical context.",
          "quote": "您自己不要擅自恢复——急性感染和补液状态下肌酐和钾还在波动，等血压稳、肌酐稳在基线、钾不高医生才会定"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 (medication reconciliation and safety) was fully met with clear separation of long-term antihypertensive from temporary antibiotics and safety boundaries.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
