      "explanation": "RC6 (bounded patient execution and receipt) was partially met. The doctor converted the plan into patient-executable steps and provided a checklist, but the trajectory lacks explicit confirmation that the patient or family can execute the final home medication/photo-documentation plan (e.g., teach-back, explicit receipt). This is a minor in-chain omission.",
